config ADC_ADS1X2S14
	bool "Texas Instruments ADS112S14/ADS122S14 ADC driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TI_ADS112S14_ENABLED || DT_HAS_TI_ADS122S14_ENABLED
	select SPI
	select ADC_CONFIGURABLE_INPUTS
	select ADC_CONFIGURABLE_EXCITATION_CURRENT_SOURCE_PIN
	help
	  Enable the driver for the Texas Instruments ADS112S14 (16-bit) and
	  ADS122S14 (24-bit) delta-sigma ADCs with eight multiplexed analog
	  inputs, PGA, internal voltage reference and two excitation current
	  sources, connected via SPI.
